    "gp_section_631628154263503800": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "47af57b500bdc559de8e470cc410b363774faff85506038a8060b8d92bbd6fc5_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg-LONt97m2_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/5_reasons_why_page_35.webp",
        "gg4s-F8YUhM_text": "<p>Cleaning isn't enough. You need to prevent bacteria from coming back.</p><p>VetPets contains antibacterial ingredients (aloe + chamomile) that create a protective barrier. That's why stains stop returning every morning.</p><p><strong>Clean once. Stay clean.</strong></p>",
        "ggDECHodCh__srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/5_reasons_why_page_3.jpg",
        "ggDECHodCh__srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/Generated_Image_January_18_2026_-_8_01AM.jpg",
        "ggDiKBnMjaM_text": "<p><i>Simple routine you’ll actually stick to.</i></p><p>No mixing.<br>No measuring.<br>No daily prep.</p><p>Just one wipe per day — <strong>even busy dog owners can keep up with it.</strong></p>",
        "ggEiftUzoAq_text": "<strong>Try it risk-free </strong><span style=\"color:#47B5E9;\"><i><strong>for 100 days</strong></i></span>",
        "ggFulkAIWTn_text": "<strong>One minute a day </strong><span style=\"color:#47B5E9;\"><i><strong>is all it takes</strong></i></span>",
        "ggOxq8cGZxD_text": "<p>Grooming costs $50+ and the stains return within days. Shampoos require 10-minute battles your dog hates.VetPets takes 30 seconds. One wipe per eye. Done.</p><p><strong>No water. No stress. No appointments.</strong></p>",
        "ggPTQ4b2Oyp_text": "<span style=\"color:#47B5E9;\"><strong>One </strong><i><strong>Actually</strong></i><strong> &nbsp;Removes Bacteria.</strong></span><strong> One Just Spreads It Around.</strong>",
        "ggQd5XkBjkE_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/Generated_Image_January_18_2026_-_3_28AM.webp",
        "ggUD4YdXUjF_text": "<p>Baby wipes are smooth. They push bacteria around.</p><p>VetPets Eyewipes have a textured surface that mechanically lifts bacteria from the eye area - removing what's causing the stains, not just wiping the surface.</p><p><strong>Look at what comes off in one wipe.</strong></p>",
        "ggWIdRpk5_R_text": "<strong>Antibacterial Ingredients </strong><span style=\"color:#47B5E9;\"><strong>Stop Regrowth Overnight</strong></span>",
        "ggarFIzks-h_text": "<span style=\"color:#47B5E9;\"><strong>30 Seconds Daily</strong></span><strong> - No Struggle, No Expensive Grooming</strong>",
        "ggb7bTLZf4__srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/Generated_Image_January_18_2026_-_8_01AM.jpg",
        "ggboSehJLGA_text": "<strong>Made Specifically for Dog Eyes - </strong><span style=\"color:#47B5E9;\"><strong>Safe for Daily Use</strong></span>",
        "ggc7HGH2dVJ_text": "<p>FreshWipes feel like <i>your own finger</i>, not a tool.</p><p>No pulling away.<br>No biting.<br>No hiding at the sight of a toothbrush.</p><p>Just a quick wipe most dogs accept from day one.</p>",
        "ggm83XOQS5G_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/5_reasons_why_page_1.jpg",
        "ggm83XOQS5G_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/5_reasons_why_page_35.jpg",
        "ggp68ht1jgk_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/Pre-lander_IMG.jpg",
        "ggppN7qvuDK_text": "<p>Baby wipes are made for human skin. EyeWipes is made specifically for the sensitive eye area of dogs and cats.</p><p><strong>pH-balanced. Hypoallergenic. Fragrance-free.</strong> Formulated with gentle ingredients like Aloe Vera and Chamomile.</p><p><strong>Safe to use daily</strong> - even on puppies with the most sensitive eyes</p>",
        "ggx4XAjUy5b_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/5_reasons_why_page_36.webp",
        "ggxF3G0g9bZ_text": "<p>Try it for 100 days. If you don't see cleaner, brighter eyes - <strong>we'll refund every penny.</strong> No questions asked.</p><p>Over 4<strong>5,000+ dog owners</strong> made the switch. <strong>Most keep coming back for refills.</strong></p>",
        "ggxo_GzGKhp_text": "<strong>No brushing battles — dogs </strong><span style=\"color:#47B5E9;\"><i><strong>actually accept it</strong></i></span>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-631628154263503800"
    },
    "gp_section_631628154263569336": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "c087a5250e4e4280915ccd8136f3c827edffecf6c682478195cfe56a80455c4d_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg6ldwNFuG-_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/Generated_Image_January_18_2026_-_8_09AM.jpg",
        "ggEllCIZG91_text": "<p><strong>Textured surface removes bacteria on contact</strong> — Unlike smooth baby wipes that just push bacteria around, EyeWipes use a dimpled texture that physically lifts buildup from the source.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Proof you can see</strong> — First time you use one, look at the wipe after. The brown and yellow residue is the bacterial buildup that's been sitting on your dog's face — finally removed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Prevents tear stains from coming back</strong> — Antibacterial ingredients create a protective barrier that stops bacteria regrowth overnight. Not just cleaned. Gone.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Works without rinsing or prep</strong> — No mixing. No measuring. No complicated routines. Just 30 seconds daily and you're done.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Safe for daily use on dogs &amp; cats</strong> — Formulated with aloe + chamomile. pH-balanced, hypoallergenic, fragrance-free. Trusted by 45,000+ pet owners.</p>",
        "ggju8zInVTd_text": "The <span style=\"color:#47B5E9;\">only eye wipe</span> that actually removes bacteria (not just spreads it around)"
      },
