    "gp_section_631628154263634872": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "e43b9b73a3083555b6747d6174bac0151744285e4bf61faf82be1e9c9e1b61f4_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg3ulpiTVoK_text": "<p>I thought it would be complicated but it's literally just wipe around the eyes once a day. Takes maybe 20 seconds. My dog doesn't even resist. Stains are almost completely gone after 2 weeks.</p>",
        "gg5_ocAu_O3_text": "<p>— <strong>Karen S., Bichon Frisé owner</strong></p>",
        "gg9uxpfOZ6G_text": "<p>— <strong>Susan T., Poodle owner</strong></p>",
        "ggAvKAF--NV_text": "Real results from <span style=\"color:#47B5E9;\"><i>real dog owners</i></span>",
        "ggCeieA21W2_text": "<p><strong>So much easier than I expected</strong></p>",
        "ggD65W9-YZz_text": "<p>My vet recommended these</p>",
        "ggDbk2gagC7_text": "<p>I've tried tear stain removers, special shampoos, even changed her food. Nothing worked. These wipes actually cleared the stains in about 2 weeks. I wish I'd found these months ago.</p>",
        "ggFL6SJnUJv_text": "<p>You can see the bacteria</p>",
        "ggOgpQOlJeM_text": "<p>— <strong>Margaret W., Maltipoo owner</strong></p>",
