        "ggaND8cnrh4_text": "<p>No more vet visits for this</p>",
        "ggb9iNg7kP4_text": "<p><strong>Finally something that works</strong></p>",
        "ggdtZsjo2-K_text": "<p>Used to take my dog to the groomer every month just for the tear stains. Now I do it myself in 30 seconds daily. Saves me time and money, and the results are actually better.</p>",
        "ggqFsDvh6T5_text": "<p>— <strong>Linda M., Maltese owner</strong></p>",
        "ggrph4zXdQQ_text": "<p><i>The first wipe came back covered in brown and yellow stuff I didn't even know was there. That's what convinced me this was actually working. Way more effective than baby wipes ever were.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggtUy4QQ3_n_text": "<p>Loved by 45,000<strong>+</strong> dog owners worldwide</p>"
